[93.031703, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m7\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\nmailman --run-as-root -C /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg create --help 2>&1; echo '---aliases help---'; mailman --run-as-root -C /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg aliases \r\n--help 2>&1; echo '---postfix config package docs---'; zcat /usr/share/doc/mailman3/README* 2>/dev/null | head -100; ls /usr/share/doc/mailman3; grep -R \r\n\"postfix_lmtp\\|mailman_destination\\|transport_maps\" -n /usr/share/doc/mailman3 /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/mailman 2>/dev/null | head -40\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
