[170.071497, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\nset -x\r\npostfix check\r\npostfix start\r\nsleep 1\r\npostfix status\r\nservice mailman3 start\r\nsleep 3\r\nservice mailman3 status 2>&1 || true\r\nps aux | grep -E 'mailman|postfix|python3.*runner|master' | grep -v grep\r\nss -ltnp | grep -E ':25|:8024' || true\r\necho '---mailman logs---'\r\ntail -50 /var/log/mailman3/mailman.log 2>/dev/null\r\ntail -50 /var/log/mailman3/smtp.log 2>/dev/null\r\ntail -50 /var/log/mailman3/error.log 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
